Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Adds NebulaDagSnapshot which captures the per-tick task list
shape (taskId, taskType, wildcard/global/parallelSafe flags) when
nebula.debug.dag-visualization (or -Dnebula.dag.capture) is set.

The snapshot is cheap to allocate (one record per task, no edge
copy yet) and provides a starting point for the §12.3 diff
locator workstream. /nebula dag renders summary stats; full DOT
export is a Phase 3 nice-to-have.

NebulaConfig.dagVisualization() now exposes the previously-
unread debug.dag-visualization yaml field.

Closes the §12.3 / §15.3 dag command + flag gap surfaced by
the P5 architecture audit.

